  "html": "<section class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align icon-plus-title is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-secondary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-plumbing\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"has-link-color wp-elements-2 wp-block-post-title has-text-color has-secondary-color has-x-large-font-size\">Well Pump Services</h1></div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group services-hero-description flow is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<p>Maintain a steady supply of clean, fresh water with our professional well pump services in Durham, NC. We specialize in the installation, repair, and maintenance of all types of well pumps, including submersible and jet pumps. Our experienced technicians ensure your well pump operates reliably, providing your home with a consistent water supply.</p>\n\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 full-width-mobile schedule-and-call-cta is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group schedule-cta-container is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<a href=\"/bookings\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta se-widget-button\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-event\" /></svg><span >Schedule Now</span>\n\n</a>\n\n    <p class=\"horizon-text has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">or speak with an expert!</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+13362819025\" aria-label=\"Call now: +13362819025\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta phone-link\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span data-show-on=\"desktop\">(336) 281-9025</span>\n        <span data-show-on=\"mobile\">Call Now</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size text-center wp-elements-3 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same Day Appointments Available by Phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1800\" height=\"1200\" src=\"/images/2024/02/plumbing-services-well-pump.jpg\" class=\"attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image\" alt=\"A well pump installed outside of a home\" style=\"object-fit:cover;\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/plumbing-services-well-pump.jpg 1800w, /images/2024/02/plumbing-services-well-pump-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/02/plumbing-services-well-pump-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/02/plumbing-services-well-pump-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/02/plumbing-services-well-pump-1536x1024.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1010px) 100vw, (max-width: 1440px) 50vw, 768px\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\"></div>\n\n</section>\n<!-- container /--><div id=\"types-of-services\" class=\"types-of-service-container container py-5 wp-elements-4 has-custom-acf-color has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\"><!-- wp-block-columns/ -->\n        <div data-num-of-columns=\"3\" class=\"wp-block-columns mb-4 is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-layout-1 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n    <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-installation\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Well Pump Installations</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>We install all major types of well pumps, including submersible pumps, jet pumps for shallow and deep wells, constant pressure systems, and booster pumps. The right choice depends on your well&#8217;s depth, your household&#8217;s water demand, and your home&#8217;s existing setup. Our technicians assess your well and recommend the system that actually fits rather than defaulting to whatever is easiest to install.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-toolbox\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Well Pump Inspections & Repair</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>Fluctuating pressure, a pump that will not turn on, or water that suddenly looks or smells off are all reasons to call before the problem gets worse. Our technicians diagnose the actual cause, whether that is a failing pressure switch, sediment buildup, a worn motor, or something further down in the well, and most repairs are completed in a few hours. Where sediment or mineral content is the underlying issue, pairing the repair with <a href=\"/services/plumbing/water-treatment-filtration\">water treatment</a> protects the new components.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        <!-- column/ -->\n        <div class=\"wp-block-column flow is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n            <div class=\"types-of-service__icon-title\">\n                    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"0\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-technician\" /></svg>    </div>\n                                        <h2 class=\"h3 text-left mt-0 font-size-5\">Customer Satisfaction</h2>\n                                    </div>\n                            <p>At the core of our business is a commitment to customer satisfaction. We prioritize exceptional service at every step, from initial consultations to follow-up support, ensuring that every client feels valued and heard. By focusing on quality workmanship, transparent communication, and attentive service, we aim to exceed expectations and build lasting relationships with our customers. Your satisfaction is our top priority, and we continuously strive to provide experiences that foster trust and loyalty.</p>\n                            </div><!-- ./column -->\n        </div><!-- ./ wp-block-columns --> </div><!-- ./container -->\n<div class=\"our-promise container \" id=\"our-promise\">\n<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\">\n\n<figure class=\"our-promise__photo\">\n<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-working-on-a-toilets-plumbing-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A Happy Home Services technician working on a toilets plumbing\" srcset=\"/images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-working-on-a-toilets-plumbing-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-working-on-a-toilets-plumbing-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-working-on-a-toilets-plumbing-768x512.jpg 768w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-working-on-a-toilets-plumbing-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /images/2024/03/A-Happy-Home-Service-technician-working-on-a-toilets-plumbing.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" /></figure>\n<div class=\"our-promise__info\">\n    <p class=\"h3 our-promise__info__headline\">Licensed Plumbers Offering Plumbing Solutions in Durham, NC and Surrounding Research Triangle Region</p>\n    <div class=\"our-promise__info__description\">Experience superior plumbing services with Happy Home Services in Durham, NC, where we are dedicated to providing top-quality solutions tailored to meet your home’s unique needs. Our team of skilled plumbers specializes in expert installations and fast, reliable repairs, ensuring that every aspect of your plumbing system runs smoothly. Whether you’re dealing with a leaky faucet, a clogged drain, or require a complete plumbing overhaul, we have the expertise to deliver efficient and dependable service every time. We pride ourselves on our commitment to customer satisfaction, offering transparent pricing and personalized solutions that address your specific concerns. As a trusted local provider, we understand the importance of a well-functioning plumbing system for your daily comfort and convenience. Our goal is to exceed your expectations with our prompt response times and quality workmanship, making us your go-to choice for all plumbing needs in Durham and surrounding areas. Contact us today to schedule your service and experience the difference of working with a professional team dedicated to keeping your home’s plumbing in top shape!</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div  class=\"container splitter makes-and-models has-background has-white-background-color\" style=\"--CTX-container-split-size: 0.5\">\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--left splitter-column--center\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n        <div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\">\n\n<div  class=\"logogrid\" style=\"--count: 14;\">\n    <ul role=\"list\" class=\"logocarousel-list\" style=\"--logo-count:14;\">\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"167\" src=\"/images/2024/02/amana-vector-logo-300x167.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Amana logo\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/amana-vector-logo-300x167.png 300w, /images/2024/02/amana-vector-logo-768x427.png 768w, /images/2024/02/amana-vector-logo.png 900w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" /></div>        </li>\n            <li class=\"logogrid-item\">\n            <div class=\"logogrid-wrap\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"/images/2024/02/ruud-3d-square-300x300.png\" class=\"logogrid-image\" alt=\"Ruud logo\" srcset=\"/images/2024/02/ruud-3d-square-300x300.png 300w, /images/2024/02/ruud-3d-square-150x150.png 150w, /images/2024/02/ruud-3d-square-768x768.png 768w, /images/2024/02/ruud-3d-square.png 900